br><br>More powerful enemies also await when you find the coordinates to boss locations. Each of them reward parts for upgrades on defeat and are necessary to defeat to progress to their rank.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/154738ad8c660b8705944a785cd93cd3.poster.avif?t=1726671426\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/154738ad8c660b8705944a785cd93cd3.webm?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/154738ad8c660b8705944a785cd93cd3.mp4?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/401d22ae8235718e2975cca0484fb3b4.webp?t=1726671426\" /></div><br>You\u2019ll go into a wide variety of arenas. Many of them will be open, sprawling areas, that can be several different biomes, where you\u2019ll primarily gather resources to rebuild your island and create new gear and tech. These large arenas will also be full of enemies, too, so watch your back while you\u2019re gathering resources.<br><br><strong>If you die in the arena, you\u2019ll lose everything you gathered in that arena. So, be careful if you\u2019re low on health and see that shiny gold node off in the distance.</strong><br><br>Other arenas include cramped quarter combat arenas where your goal will just be to defeat the enemy and gameshows. Gameshows range from easy to complete to incredibly difficult but can have wonderful rewards.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/8ffbc7e69d8385818e34a6a1fa066e70.poster.avif?t=1726671426\" ><