s, and armor to food that gives you buffs and furniture.<br><br>Food will play an important role in the arenas, especially at lower levels. Most prepared food will provide boosts to stats and regeneration. Try to always eat before heading into an arena.<br><br>Some recipes for meals will have to be found or bought out in the world but a lot of recipes will be automatically learned just from picking up the ingredients. You\u2019ll even be able to grow ingredients on your farm!<br><br>Weapons and armor can be upgraded if you find the right recipe and the right materials to use.<br><br>Some of the islanders can even make you gadgets like grenades that instantly gather materials or emergency escape portals so you can get out of an arena quick!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/e8e5f203ec0a1029b3a155bf1a815d5c.webp?t=1726671426\" /></div><br>The ruins of an old community are scattered across your island. Find the right people and the right materials and you can rebuild the ruins, creating your own personal town. Each building you finish unlocks new recipes, new tech, new buildings, or several other things.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/169eec286b4f3775fed59f4ac724edcb.poster.avif?t=1726671426\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/169eec286b4f3775fed59f4ac724edcb.webm?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/169eec286b4f3775fed59f4ac724edcb.mp4?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Custom buildings can also be built and placed anywhere on the island. Not much for building custom buildings? You can also find a variety of blueprints to create pre-fabricated houses that are just drop-and-live-in.<br><br>There are over 100 pieces of furniture to find, craft, and place on the island, allowing you to decorate as much (or as little) as you want.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/2c323b3271e6b389e725520583b343be.poster.avif?t=1726671426\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/2c323b3271e6b389e725520583b343be.webm?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/2c323b3271e6b389e725520583b343be.mp4?t=1726671426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2060580/extras/bd090c6ef511397c87e05ebeac827546.webp?t=1726671426\" /></div><br>I\u2019m a solo developer and available frequently on Discord. I welcome anyone to join and I welcome any suggestions, comments, criticism, or whatever feedback you want to give! I want Crossedland to be a wonderful thing and I need your input to do that!",
